Abstract = {Visual selective attention modeling is an advanced topic in cognitive
   information perception. According to human visual perception theory,
   which is based on the introduction of the representative visual
   attention model (Itti model), in its initial stages of feature
   extraction, in order to form a new guidance note of the saliency map,
   new low-level visual features are introduced, which achieves a more
   accurate target detection. The results prove that this method can avoid
   the leakage detection to some extent, which makes attention regional
   more close to the actuality of biological visual system.},
