   developed in which based on a paint board where various characters are
   designed that are related to children's emotions and preferences, such
   as (1) Shapes (2) Fruits, (3) Vehicles, (4) Clothes, (5) Animals, (6)
   Numbers, (7) Colors. The corresponding sound and English pronunciation
