Abstract = {The influence of affect has become a hot topic in organizational
   research. This chapter seeks to expand the conceptualization of affect
   at work to include the role of unconscious affect. In this chapter, we
   review current research and theory on unconscious affect and extend
   those findings to organizationally relevant situations. We propose
   several antecedents, moderators, and outcomes of unconscious affect at
   work.},
